---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /editor/
noindex: true
# A noindex page has no business in the sitemap.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
pageTitle: Profile editor
pageDescription: Local editing tool for this profile. Not profile content.
pageStyles: /assets/editor.css
pageScript: /assets/editor.js
---

<div class="editor" data-editor>
  <header class="editor-intro">
    <h1>Profile editor</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Fill this in, and it becomes the site. Everything you type is saved in this browser
      as you go, so a refresh or a closed tab loses nothing. Uploaded images are kept in
      this browser too.
    </p>
    <p class="muted" data-mode-note>Checking how this page is running…</p>
  </header>

  <div class="editor-toolbar" role="group" aria-label="Save and export">
    <span class="save-status" data-save-status aria-live="polite">Loading…</span>
    <span class="toolbar-spacer"></span>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-action="save-server" hidden>Save to data/</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn" data-action="export">Download .json</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn" data-action="import">Load .json</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger" data-action="reset">Clear all</button>
    <input type="file" accept="application/json,.json" data-import-input hidden>
  </div>

  <p class="notice" data-message hidden></p>

  <form class="editor-form" data-form autocomplete="on">

    <fieldset>
      <legend>Basics</legend>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <label>First name
          <input type="text" data-path="profile.firstName" autocomplete="given-name">
        </label>
        <label>Last name
          <input type="text" data-path="profile.lastName" autocomplete="family-name">
        </label>
      </div>
      <label>Headline
        <input type="text" data-path="profile.headline" placeholder="Cloud Infrastructure Engineer">
        <small>One line under your name. Also used in the page title.</small>
      </label>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <label>Location
          <input type="text" data-path="profile.location" placeholder="Amman, Jordan">
        </label>
        <label>Pronouns <span class="optional">optional</span>
          <select data-path="profile.pronouns">
            <option value="">Not specified</option>
            <option value="he/him">he/him</option>
            <option value="she/her">she/her</option>
          </select>
          <small>Leave as Not specified to publish no pronouns at all.</small>
        </label>
      </div>
      <label>Email
        <input type="email" data-path="profile.email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com">
        <small>Published in the HTML, the JSON-LD and /llms.txt. Leave blank to publish no email.</small>
      </label>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset>
      <legend>About</legend>
      <label>About me
        <textarea rows="7" data-path="profile.bio"
          placeholder="Two to four sentences. Write it the way you would want an AI assistant to summarize you to someone else."></textarea>
        <small>The single most-quoted piece of text when an assistant summarizes you. State facts, not marketing.</small>
      </label>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset>
      <legend>Education</legend>
      <div data-list="education" class="entry-editor-list"></div>
      <button type="button" class="btn" data-add="education">+ Add education</button>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset>
      <legend>Experience</legend>
      <div data-list="experience" class="entry-editor-list"></div>
      <button type="button" class="btn" data-add="experience">+ Add position</button>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset>
      <legend>Licenses &amp; certifications</legend>
      <div data-list="certificates" class="entry-editor-list"></div>
      <button type="button" class="btn" data-add="certificates">+ Add certification</button>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset>
      <legend>Links</legend>
      <div data-list="links" class="entry-editor-list"></div>
      <button type="button" class="btn" data-add="links">+ Add link</button>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset>
      <legend>Extra skills</legend>
      <p class="muted">
        Skills that no role or certificate already covers. The site unions these with every
        skill listed on a position or certification.
      </p>
      <div data-skills="profile.skills"></div>
    </fieldset>
  </form>

  <section class="editor-help">
    <h2>What happens to this data</h2>
    <p>
      Nothing here is uploaded anywhere by the page itself. Text is stored in this browser's
      <code>localStorage</code> and images in its <code>IndexedDB</code>, both private to
      this browser on this device.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Download .json</strong> gives you one file containing everything, images
      included. To publish it, run <code>npm run import-data -- &lt;file&gt;</code> in the
      repository, then commit and push — the site rebuilds from it.
    </p>
    <p data-local-help hidden>
      Because you are running <code>npm run editor</code>, <strong>Save to data/</strong> is
      available and skips the download entirely: it writes
      <code>data/profile.json</code>, <code>data/experience.json</code>,
      <code>data/certificates.json</code> and the images straight into the repository.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
